# ==============================================================================
# CaSDaR pipeline .gitignore
#
# This repository holds code plus the earlier master template versions in
# templates/ (see README's "What this repository contains").
# Every script in this pipeline reads/writes real job-ad text, HR-derived
# data, or scored output relative to the folder these scripts live in - none
# of that should ever be committed here, even accidentally by someone running
# the pipeline against real data in a local clone. When in doubt, add rather
# than remove an entry below.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Inputs the scripts read (never part of this repo) ----------------------
/PDFs/
/Validation_PDFs/
/Data/

# --- Everything the scripts write ---------------------------------------------
/Output/
/Validation_Output/
/TXTs/
/TXTs_merged/
/TXTs_extracted/
/Validation_TXTs/
/Validation_TXTs_merged/
/Validation_TXTs_extracted/
**/sampling_snapshots/
**/master_template_versions/
**/master_template_comparisons/
**/item_coverage_groups/
**/logs/

# --- Specific file types produced by the pipeline (belt-and-braces, in case
# any of the above folder patterns don't match a future layout change) ------
*.rds
similarity_scoring_config.yml

# --- R / RStudio housekeeping --------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rdata
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# --- OS / editor junk -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp